[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 4.54,
    "text": "What if the ultimate achievement is actually a suicide mission into a world",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0001",
    "index": 1
  },
  {
    "start": 4.54,
    "end": 6.74,
    "text": "that does not want you to exist?",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0002",
    "index": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 6.74,
    "end": 12.6,
    "text": "Can a builder's logic survive in a dimension designed to delete everything it touches?",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0003",
    "index": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 12.6,
    "end": 14.68,
    "text": "[B-ROLL: REACTION]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0004",
    "index": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 14.68,
    "end": 20.08,
    "text": "The void is screaming, and the shadows of the end are beginning to hunt.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0005",
    "index": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 20.08,
    "end": 22.68,
    "text": "The dimension shift is a rupture.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0006",
    "index": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 22.68,
    "end": 26.58,
    "text": "Steve feels his data being torn down",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0007",
    "index": 7
  },
  {
    "start": 26.58,
    "end": 29.18,
    "text": "and recompiled at a lower resolution.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0008",
    "index": 8
  },
  {
    "start": 29.18,
    "end": 32.96,
    "text": "The heat of the overworld is gone, replaced",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0009",
    "index": 9
  },
  {
    "start": 32.96,
    "end": 36.74,
    "text": "by a cold that is an absence of existence.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0010",
    "index": 10
  },
  {
    "start": 36.74,
    "end": 42.04,
    "text": "When he opens his eyes, he is standing on a platform of smooth obsidian.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0011",
    "index": 11
  },
  {
    "start": 42.04,
    "end": 46.78,
    "text": "The screen flickers with purple static.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0012",
    "index": 12
  },
  {
    "start": 46.78,
    "end": 50.7,
    "text": "There is a place where the grid collapses into the null vector.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0013",
    "index": 13
  },
  {
    "start": 50.7,
    "end": 53.22,
    "text": "Welcome to the end.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0014",
    "index": 14
  },
  {
    "start": 53.22,
    "end": 57.34,
    "text": "[B-ROLL / PAUSE]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0015",
    "index": 15
  },
  {
    "start": 57.34,
    "end": 62.58,
    "text": "This is the dimension of finality, the home of the unwritten",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0016",
    "index": 16
  },
  {
    "start": 62.58,
    "end": 65.26,
    "text": "[B-ROLL: PAUSE]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0017",
    "index": 17
  },
  {
    "start": 65.26,
    "end": 68.44,
    "text": "the islands float in an infinite void.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0018",
    "index": 18
  },
  {
    "start": 68.44,
    "end": 71.04,
    "text": "This is the Architect's true cage.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0019",
    "index": 19
  },
  {
    "start": 71.04,
    "end": 73.84,
    "text": "[B-ROLL / PAUSE]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0020",
    "index": 20
  },
  {
    "start": 73.84,
    "end": 76.98,
    "text": "Steve has crossed the threshold.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0021",
    "index": 21
  },
  {
    "start": 76.98,
    "end": 80.7,
    "text": "He has entered the Dragon's Lair.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0022",
    "index": 22
  },
  {
    "start": 80.7,
    "end": 84.58,
    "text": "and the dragon is already dreaming",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0023",
    "index": 23
  },
  {
    "start": 84.58,
    "end": 88.92,
    "text": "of his deletion. Steve steps onto the pale yellow",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0024",
    "index": 24
  },
  {
    "start": 88.92,
    "end": 91.58,
    "text": "end stone of the central island.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0025",
    "index": 25
  },
  {
    "start": 91.58,
    "end": 96.18,
    "text": "Every footstep is a thud",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0026",
    "index": 26
  },
  {
    "start": 96.18,
    "end": 98.76,
    "text": "that echoes through the void.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0027",
    "index": 27
  },
  {
    "start": 98.76,
    "end": 102.62,
    "text": "His diamond armor glows a high specular",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0028",
    "index": 28
  },
  {
    "start": 102.62,
    "end": 106.48,
    "text": "cyan, a foreign element in this perfect void.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0029",
    "index": 29
  },
  {
    "start": 106.48,
    "end": 111.14,
    "text": "Alex teleports onto the island, in a burst of purple particles,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0030",
    "index": 30
  },
  {
    "start": 111.14,
    "end": 114.22,
    "text": "her enchanted bow drawn.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0031",
    "index": 31
  },
  {
    "start": 114.22,
    "end": 118.1,
    "text": "Barclay whimpers, his fur coated in void mist.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0032",
    "index": 32
  },
  {
    "start": 118.1,
    "end": 122.34,
    "text": "Above them, towering obsidian pillars reach toward the sky,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0033",
    "index": 33
  },
  {
    "start": 122.34,
    "end": 125.82,
    "text": "each topped with a spinning end crystal emitting a low,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0034",
    "index": 34
  },
  {
    "start": 125.82,
    "end": 131.2,
    "text": "pulsing thrump. The grid is dead here, Steve. Alex whispers.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0035",
    "index": 35
  },
  {
    "start": 131.2,
    "end": 136.66,
    "text": "There's no coordinate system. The map is blank.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0036",
    "index": 36
  },
  {
    "start": 136.66,
    "end": 139.06,
    "text": "[B-ROLL: TRANSITION]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0037",
    "index": 37
  },
  {
    "start": 139.06,
    "end": 141.88,
    "text": "Steve does not answer.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0038",
    "index": 38
  },
  {
    "start": 141.88,
    "end": 145.38,
    "text": "He looks up. A massive,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0039",
    "index": 39
  },
  {
    "start": 145.38,
    "end": 149.16,
    "text": "blocky shadow detaches itself from the bedrock.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0040",
    "index": 40
  },
  {
    "start": 149.16,
    "end": 151.88,
    "text": "It is the Ender Dragon.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0041",
    "index": 41
  },
  {
    "start": 151.88,
    "end": 156.96,
    "text": "Her obsidian scales reflect the light of the crystals.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0042",
    "index": 42
  },
  {
    "start": 156.96,
    "end": 160.18,
    "text": "She opens her mouth, revealing a purple void,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0043",
    "index": 43
  },
  {
    "start": 160.18,
    "end": 163.62,
    "text": "and lets out a roar of corrupted audio and static.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0044",
    "index": 44
  },
  {
    "start": 163.62,
    "end": 167.04,
    "text": "[B-ROLL: TRANSITION]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0045",
    "index": 45
  },
  {
    "start": 167.04,
    "end": 169.42,
    "text": "[B-ROLL: REACTION]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0046",
    "index": 46
  },
  {
    "start": 169.42,
    "end": 175.38,
    "text": "The Sentinel of the Void is awake.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0047",
    "index": 47
  },
  {
    "start": 175.38,
    "end": 181.28,
    "text": "Jean does not see Steve as a hero, she sees him as a virus,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0048",
    "index": 48
  },
  {
    "start": 181.28,
    "end": 185.42,
    "text": "a data leak that must be patched.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0049",
    "index": 49
  },
  {
    "start": 185.42,
    "end": 188.0,
    "text": "The dragon dives.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0050",
    "index": 50
  },
  {
    "start": 188.0,
    "end": 191.34,
    "text": "She unleashes a torrent of dragon's breath,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0051",
    "index": 51
  },
  {
    "start": 191.34,
    "end": 196.38,
    "text": "a purple acid that instantly pixelates the end stone it touches.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0052",
    "index": 52
  },
  {
    "start": 196.38,
    "end": 200.82,
    "text": "Steve lunges, using his fragmented arm to pulse a cyan gravity wave,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0053",
    "index": 53
  },
  {
    "start": 200.82,
    "end": 203.54,
    "text": "pushing himself and Alex away.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0054",
    "index": 54
  },
  {
    "start": 203.54,
    "end": 207.58,
    "text": "The acid consumes the stone with a deafening hiss.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0055",
    "index": 55
  },
  {
    "start": 207.58,
    "end": 211.9,
    "text": "[B-ROLL / PAUSE]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0056",
    "index": 56
  },
  {
    "start": 211.9,
    "end": 217.54,
    "text": "A beam of purple light connects the dragon to the crystal.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0057",
    "index": 57
  },
  {
    "start": 217.54,
    "end": 221.0,
    "text": "She is healing. Ein Tier der Dienste,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0058",
    "index": 58
  },
  {
    "start": 221.0,
    "end": 223.94,
    "text": "ein der Leitungen der Einwahr, and Serie A B,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0059",
    "index": 59
  },
  {
    "start": 223.94,
    "end": 228.72,
    "text": "eine Dierer der Auernahmen. Her source code is invulnerable.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0060",
    "index": 60
  },
  {
    "start": 228.72,
    "end": 234.18,
    "text": "Steve points his diamond sword toward the pillar. Derl.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0061",
    "index": 61
  },
  {
    "start": 234.18,
    "end": 237.74,
    "text": "The crystals, Alex. Tau.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0062",
    "index": 62
  },
  {
    "start": 237.74,
    "end": 240.22,
    "text": "We have to destroy the link.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0063",
    "index": 63
  },
  {
    "start": 240.22,
    "end": 243.22,
    "text": "The pillars are too high, Steve.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0064",
    "index": 64
  },
  {
    "start": 243.22,
    "end": 248.28,
    "text": "We have to build a way up. This is the moment of realization.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0065",
    "index": 65
  },
  {
    "start": 248.28,
    "end": 253.78,
    "text": "The battle for the end is not a battle of strength.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0066",
    "index": 66
  },
  {
    "start": 253.78,
    "end": 257.36,
    "text": "It is a battle of construction in the heart of destruction.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0067",
    "index": 67
  },
  {
    "start": 257.36,
    "end": 260.16,
    "text": "[B-ROLL / PAUSE]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0068",
    "index": 68
  },
  {
    "start": 260.16,
    "end": 263.96,
    "text": "Steve looks at the end stone beneath his boots.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0069",
    "index": 69
  },
  {
    "start": 263.96,
    "end": 267.7,
    "text": "The legend is not just a warrior.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0070",
    "index": 70
  },
  {
    "start": 267.7,
    "end": 270.58,
    "text": "He is the sovereign builder.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0071",
    "index": 71
  },
  {
    "start": 270.58,
    "end": 273.0,
    "text": "The gauntlet is thrown.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0072",
    "index": 72
  },
  {
    "start": 273.0,
    "end": 278.62,
    "text": "Dot. Steve must build toward the gods to save his people below.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0073",
    "index": 73
  },
  {
    "start": 278.62,
    "end": 282.56,
    "text": "He has the diamond armor,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0074",
    "index": 74
  },
  {
    "start": 282.56,
    "end": 285.42,
    "text": "but Zhiyun has the immortality.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0075",
    "index": 75
  },
  {
    "start": 285.42,
    "end": 291.3,
    "text": "In a world of a thousand chapters, the final battle has found its coordinate.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0076",
    "index": 76
  },
  {
    "start": 291.3,
    "end": 294.84,
    "text": "The hunt for the end is over. over.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0077",
    "index": 77
  },
  {
    "start": 294.84,
    "end": 297.62,
    "text": "The war for the end.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0078",
    "index": 78
  },
  {
    "start": 297.62,
    "end": 299.86,
    "text": "The war has just begun.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0079",
    "index": 79
  },
  {
    "start": 299.86,
    "end": 302.6,
    "text": "[B-ROLL: TRANSITION]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0080",
    "index": 80
  },
  {
    "start": 302.6,
    "end": 306.32,
    "text": "We have learned that even in the most absolute void,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0081",
    "index": 81
  },
  {
    "start": 306.32,
    "end": 312.15,
    "text": "our ability to build and create remains our most powerful weapon against entropy.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0082",
    "index": 82
  },
  {
    "start": 312.15,
    "end": 316.04,
    "text": "We must realize that overcoming our greatest challenges requires",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0083",
    "index": 83
  },
  {
    "start": 316.04,
    "end": 321.88,
    "text": "us to dismantle the sources of our enemy's strength before we can ever hope to land a final blow.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0084",
    "index": 84
  },
  {
    "start": 321.88,
    "end": 324.0,
    "text": "[B-ROLL: TRANSITION]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0085",
    "index": 85
  },
  {
    "start": 324.0,
    "end": 328.26,
    "text": "True legends are formed when we stop looking for a way out and start building",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0086",
    "index": 86
  },
  {
    "start": 328.26,
    "end": 333.76,
    "text": "a way up, even when the floor beneath us is being erased.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0087",
    "index": 87
  },
  {
    "start": 333.76,
    "end": 339.34,
    "text": "The pillars are high and the dragon is diving. Do you have the blocks to reach the top?",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0088",
    "index": 88
  },
  {
    "start": 339.34,
    "end": 341.4,
    "text": "[B-ROLL: REACTION]",
    "type": "silence",
    "scene_id": "S0089",
    "index": 89
  },
  {
    "start": 341.4,
    "end": 344.55,
    "text": "Stay grounded, stay legendary.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0090",
    "index": 90
  }
]